        "Objectives Te objectives of this experiment are as follows: 1. To know the meaning of free fall and the conditions under which it occurs. 2. To know the value for the acceleration of gravity (g). 3. Corelate the motion of a free-falling object to the graphical descriptions of its motion. 4. To understand that the acceleration of gravity is independent of the mass of the free-falling object.",
